Search for strings in your project using GraphQL.

**Example Query:**
```graphql
  query Search($searchStringsFilter: SearchStringsFilter!) {
    searchStrings(searchStringsFilter: $searchStringsFilter) {
      content {
        source {
          hashcode
        }
        translations {
          translationForms {
            translationText
            pluralForm
          }
        }
      }
      totalCount
      totalWordCount
      __typename
    }
  }
```
